            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waci ri Semaya ma Nehelam ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili waco ama: I nyingin won idhiro balwa ri ji je ma jonitie i Yerusalem, kodi ri jacway ri Were i wi migam Zefania wod pa Maseya, kodi ri jocway ri Were i wi migam je, k'iwaco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth won gipi am'olokin jacway ri Were i wi migam i kabedo pa jacway ri Were i wi migam Yehoyada, ŋey jotic jowonyal bedo i Ot pa Rwoth ma geŋo ŋatimoro ma kethere ni obedo jatuci wac Were, ma ketho go i lijegere ma ŋute oŋinere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo riameno raŋo ikibwoko Yeremia ja Anathoth m'okethere ni go obedo jatuci wac Were riwin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri go obino bongi wan i Babilon, ka waco ni, “Labedo hongo malac; geti win udi wibed'iye, fur win cemo to wicamo ranyak mere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam Zefania osoma balwa me munyo jatuci wac Were Yeremia winjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to wac pa Were bino ri Yeremia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhiri ri joma nitie i wiloka je mikwenda me, k'iwaco ni, “Rwoth waco ama Semaya ja Nehelam: Kwoŋbedo Semaya otieko luwo gi win, kad'akidhiro go, aka otieko miyo win ketho geno mewin i twodo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riameno Rwoth waco ama: Akidho miyo Semaya ja Nehelam kodi nyikwaye gir'acula. Go k'obedi kodi nyatoro moro je makwo kwoŋ ji me m'onen gimaber m'akidho timo ri ji paran, Rwoth waco, rupiri go otieko luwo gwenyirok kwoŋ Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
